        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c282" value="&lt;b&gt;①&lt;/b&gt; 연결 → RG2 탐침 파지 명령 → 툴 무게·무게중심·TCP 등록 확인 → m/rad/N 변환 · 좌표계는 환경 세팅 후 확정 (6장)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C2CBD5;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=14;fontColor=#16202B;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=9;spacingRight=7;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2230" y="3716" width="420" height="76" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c283" value="&lt;b&gt;②&lt;/b&gt; MOVE_TO / HOME — 홈위치(시작위치) · 기준 원점 이동 · 피드백/취소/종료 결과 반환 (4.4.9)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C2CBD5;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=14;fontColor=#16202B;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=9;spacingRight=7;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
